<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: vivi mead -->
  <VV_Mead.label>薇薇蜜酒</VV_Mead.label>
  <!-- EN: A traditional liquor made by fermenting honey of Vivis. Surprisingly, it's not very sweet and is strong but has the distinct fragrance of honey.\n\nVivis don't prefer alcohol, but they make it to sell leftover honey at a high price due to the demand of foreigners. -->
  <VV_Mead.description>一種傳統的由薇薇蜂蜜發酵制成的酒。但它卻不是很甜很濃，不過還是有明顯的蜂蜜香味。\n\n薇薇們不喜歡喝酒，但由于外來者的需求，他們會把剩下的蜂蜜這樣高價出售。</VV_Mead.description>
