  <VV_UnfermentedMead.label>未發酵的薇薇蜜酒</VV_UnfermentedMead.label>
  <!-- EN: It is unfermented vivi mead. Ferment for 10 days at 20-28℃ (68-82℉); otherwise it spoils. -->
  <VV_UnfermentedMead.description>未發酵的薇薇蜜酒，若要發酵，溫度應當保持在20-28℃(68-82℉)。</VV_UnfermentedMead.description>
  
